of 26.000.000 Euros This debt of 26m Euros is payable over 5 years.</p>', '', '["Luxury 5 star hotel and casinoOne of the finest Colonial Style luxury 5 star 200 bed-roomed Hotel world famous guests includes American presidents John F Kennedy+1+ and Richard Nixon film stars Audrey Hepburn, Elizabeth Taylor to mention a few,the Casino has one of the most elegant gaming rooms in Europe with 20 gaming tables, including 8 French and American Roulette, 3 Baccarat, and 5 poker cash games every night, plus a grand sized automatic slots room with over 200 modern slot machines with winning jackpots of over 500,000 euros, +18 touch-bet roulette machines.I fine dining Restaurant and 1 buffet cocktail bar The hotel and casino is open and operating under Covid 19 distancing Laws Great price 55.000.000 Euros this price includes a transferable debt of 26.000.000 Euros This debt of 26m Euros is payable over 5 years."]', 0, '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z', '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z') ON CONFLICT(legacy_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title, country=excluded.country, price_text=excluded.price_text, lifecycle=excluded.lifecycle, content_review_status='pending', legacy_status=excluded.legacy_status, summary=excluded.summary, body_html=excluded.body_html, availability=excluded.availability, points_json=excluded.points_json, public_visibility=0, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
