 of car parking approx 30 cars, 10 guest rooms for the casinos clients,..","This is a great price and should be seen at 35,000,000 Euros"]', 0, '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z', '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z') ON CONFLICT(legacy_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title, country=excluded.country, price_text=excluded.price_text, lifecycle=excluded.lifecycle, content_review_status='pending', legacy_status=excluded.legacy_status, summary=excluded.summary, body_html=excluded.body_html, availability=excluded.availability, points_json=excluded.points_json, public_visibility=0, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
