orts betting and poker rooms, with 5 committed Managers overlooking 170 employees worldwide income has grown over the past 11 years to an incredible 2 billion euros gross revenue last year, full information with signed CA, NDA Price 90,000,000 Euros now OFF THE MARKET"]', 0, '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z', '2026-10-09T13:47:48.200Z') ON CONFLICT(legacy_id) DO UPDATE SET title=excluded.title, country=excluded.country, price_text=excluded.price_text, lifecycle=excluded.lifecycle, content_review_status='pending', legacy_status=excluded.legacy_status, summary=excluded.summary, body_html=excluded.body_html, availability=excluded.availability, points_json=excluded.points_json, public_visibility=0, updated_at=excluded.updated_at;
